From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:22:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] .github: the pull-request checks

Every pull request against omamobile now runs omarchy-mobile's
tools/kernel-pr-check: a human Signed-off-by from each commit's author and
none from an AI, subsystem prefixes, checkpatch --strict as the base has
it, no identifiers or blobs, and W=1 builds of the touched C files,
device trees (new warnings only, against the base) and bindings, with
dtbs_check and dt_binding_check.

This file is repository tooling, not kernel code: it stays out of every
upstream submission. The kernel's .gitignore ignores dot-directories, so
it was added with --force.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .github/workflows/checks.yml | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 47 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .github/workflows/checks.yml

diff --git a/.github/workflows/checks.yml b/.github/workflows/checks.yml
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..c6b6fda88
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.github/workflows/checks.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
+# The pull-request gate for this repository (omarchy-mobile's
+# CONTRIBUTING.md section 6.2), kept in omarchy-mobile beside the tool it
+# runs (ci/linux-omarchy-mobile/checks.yml, tools/kernel-pr-check). It
+# checks out the pull request's commits and omarchy-mobile's tools, then
+# runs the sign-off, prefix, checkpatch and identifier checks and the W=1,
+# dtbs_check and dt_binding_check builds, comparing device-tree warnings
+# with the base. Not kernel code: never part of an upstream submission.
+name: checks
+
+on:
+  pull_request:
+    branches: [omamobile]
+
+permissions:
+  contents: read
+
+concurrency:
+  group: checks-${{ github.ref }}
+  cancel-in-progress: true
+
+jobs:
+  kernel:
+    name: Kernel (sign-offs, checkpatch, W=1, dtbs_check)
+    runs-on: ubuntu-24.04
+    timeout-minutes: 60
+    steps:
+      - uses: actions/checkout@v5
+        with:
+          path: linux
+          fetch-depth: 0
+          ref: ${{ github.event.pull_request.head.sha }}
+      - name: The base
+        run: git -C linux fetch --no-tags origin "${{ github.event.pull_request.base.sha }}"
+      - uses: actions/checkout@v5
+        with:
+          repository: derekross/omarchy-mobile
+          path: omarchy-mobile
+      - name: Tools
+        run: |
+          sudo apt-get update -qq
+          sudo apt-get install -y -qq clang lld llvm bc bison flex libssl-dev libelf-dev python3-pip yamllint
+          pip install --break-system-packages dtschema
+      - name: tools/kernel-pr-check
+        run: |
+          omarchy-mobile/tools/kernel-pr-check -C linux --build "$RUNNER_TEMP/kbuild" \
+            "${{ github.event.pull_request.base.sha }}" "${{ github.event.pull_request.head.sha }}"
